<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Enhancement Shaman</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available from Celestial Dungeons in Phase 5 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. Keep in mind that these items are likely to be replaced by their Normal and Heroic raid counterparts. With that in mind, this is not a true "best in slot" list, and instead should serve as a rough guideline for what to keep an eye on from Celestial Dungeons.<br/>
<br/>Your purchase Celestial Items using <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3416/august-stone-cluster">
<span>
<img alt="August Stone Cluster" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">August Stone Cluster</span></span></a>, or they may drop from the final boss in Celestial Dungeons.<br/>
