<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Enhancement Shaman</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool and drop item level 553 Tier 16.<br/>
<br/>These World Bosses are a quick way to boost your item level until you can get your Heroic Tier items and should be done each lockout, to not miss out on possible upgrades early on.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos drops some decent pieces, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105762/smoldering-eye">
<img alt="Smoldering Eye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_mop8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Smoldering Eye</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105792/bowflight-wristguard">
<img alt="Bowflight Wristguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_mail_raidhunter_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bowflight Wristguard</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105779/light-kindler-waistguard">
<img alt="Light Kindler Waistguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Light Kindler Waistguard</span></a>. These are fairly rare, but offer great upgrades beyond celestial gear.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_staff_2h_pandarenmonk_c_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Timeless Isle Items for Enhancement Shaman</span></h2>The Timeless Isle in Phase 5 is great for catching up on gear.  You will earn <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> for almost all activities that you participate in. The Trinket <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103986/discipline-of-xuen">
<img alt="Discipline of Xuen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_tigergodcub.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Discipline of Xuen</span></a> is comparable to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105029/haromms-talisman">
<img alt="Haromm's Talisman" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Haromm's Talisman</span></a>, so whichever one you can get first will do the job, and you can use your resources on other items to progress your item level. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105924/hozen-can-opener">
<img alt="Hozen Can Opener" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hozen Can Opener</span></a> will do a great job getting you started until you can upgrade your weapons with your celestial items.<br/>
<br/>
