<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Enhancement Shaman Pre-Raid Trinkets in Phase 5</span></h2>
<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>Enhancement Shamans are still incredibly burst dps heavy, and now with access to new trinkets this will be amplified further thanks to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104974/assurance-of-consequence">
<img alt="Assurance of Consequence" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Assurance of Consequence</span></a>, which is by far the best trinket you can get.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104974/assurance-of-consequence">
<img alt="Assurance of Consequence" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Assurance of Consequence</span></a> is by far and leagues better than any other option. This trinket is a must-obtain as it synergizes immensely with the burst-heavy playstyle of Enhancement Shamans. It reduces the cooldown of all of our major damage cooldowns, such as <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=2894/fire-elemental-totem">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_elemental_totem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fire Elemental Totem</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=51533/feral-spirit">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_feralspirit.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Feral Spirit</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=114049/ascendance">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/classic_spell_fire_elementaldevastation.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ascendance</span></a>, and utility cooldowns such as <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=79206/spiritwalkers-grace">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_spiritwalkersgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spiritwalker's Grace</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=30823/shamanistic-rage">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_shamanrage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shamanistic Rage</span></a>, and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=2062/earth-elemental-totem">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_earthelemental_totem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earth Elemental Totem</span></a>.</div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105029/haromms-talisman">
<img alt="Haromm's Talisman" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Haromm's Talisman</span></a> is one of the few big Agility proc trinkets we have available from Siege of Orgrimmar, but in addition to the Agility proc, it also provides us with a decent single target Multistrike proc.</div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103986/discipline-of-xuen">
<img alt="Discipline of Xuen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_tigergodcub.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Discipline of Xuen</span></a> performs similarly to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105029/haromms-talisman">
<img alt="Haromm's Talisman" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Haromm's Talisman</span></a>; it provides desirable stats with Agility and Mastery, and due to its slightly higher item level it can stack up to the Multistrike Trinket from the Celestial rewards.</div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105082/sigil-of-rampage">
<img alt="Sigil of Rampage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sigil of Rampage</span></a> is a great choice for farming dungeons or on AoE fights in raids; it's one of the flexible items which should be swapped out with another trinket depending on the fight scenario.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="legendary-cloak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendary_theblackprince.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Legendary Cloak for Enhancement Shaman</span></h2>With the removal of Raid Finder in Mists of Pandaria Classic, it is possible to earn your Legendary Cloak without ever setting foot into a raid.  This can be done inside Celestial Dungeons.  <br/>
<br/>Our Legendary Cloak provides us with some additional passive damage, which in the endgame will end up being around 4% of our total damage output. The proc from the Legendary cloak is also frontal, which means that during AoE it will provide a nice passive increase in damage without needing much setup, which is generally one of the downfalls of Enhancement Shamans and the reliance on Fire Nova.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
